  (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "com-etzhayyim-oteint actor の設計境界(OTEINT-AR ⊣ AttributionGovernor / system-dynamics stocks-flows-feedback / standalone zero-dependency)" "おてんとさまメタファーが意味する『照らす(observe+record)』と『裁く(govern+disclose)』の責務分離不変条件" "本actor を防御的脅威インテリジェンス(threat-actor attribution)に限定する安全床スコープ(dragnet・doxxing・自警・LE直接行動の禁止)"))
  (:adr/related (vector "2607177500-cloud-itonami-jsic-4721-coldchain-warehousing-actor(standalone zero-dep actor の手本)" "2607176500-cloud-itonami-security-incident-governor(Governor + 純粋 kernel 不変条件の先例)" "2607011000(fleet standalone convention)" "2607171600(docs/ADR は EDN only)" "build-actor skill(langgraph-clj StateGraph + 封じ込め + governor + append-only 台帳)" "2605301400(tadori R0 scaffold — etzhayyim の chartered actor-attribution actor。oteint は行動activity面の sibling)" "2605192100 §1.12(Transparent Force / G3 authorized-investigation-only)" "2606160842(silenTadoriReview 自己監査 pattern — oteint.heartbeat の手本)" "2605291500(tsukuroi propose-only)"))
